<title>SWEDEN: Celsius Q1 profit slumps 40 pct.</title>
<headline>Celsius Q1 profit slumps 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997,</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   45   vs     75</p>
<p> Turnover				  2,262   vs  2,458</p>
<p> Shr (crowns)			     1.30   vs  10.20*</p>
<p> Order intake			    2,600   vs  2,004</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold		    1,792   vs  1,979</p>
<p> Other costs				 468   vs    457</p>
<p> Goodwill depreciation		    17   vs     25</p>
<p> Interests in associates		   1   vs	7</p>
<p> Operating profit			   18   vs     35</p>
<p> Net financial items	    CREDIT  27   vs     40  CREDIT</p>
<p> Minorities			   CREDIT 2   vs	1 CHARGE</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			     47   vs     74</p>
<p> Taxes					  11   vs	4</p>
<p> Net profit				   36   vs     70</p>
<p>NOTE -- Celsius is a Swedish defence industries group. *After full tax.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
